subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Clone an existing subscription

USAGE:
  subtrack clone <OPTIONS> <id>

ARGUMENTS:
  id           Subscription ID to clone

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                     Display this help message
  -v, --version                  Display this version
  --name <name>                  New name (default: '<original> (copy)')
  --price <price>                Override price
  --currency <currency>          Override currency
  --cycle <cycle>                Override cycle
  --tags <tags>                  Override tags (comma-separated)

